  "writable_parameters": [],
  "blockers": [
    "Aux function selection requires complete flash-combobox selection binding, exact IOPE macro-template registration and recognition under positive application/scene/bistable graph dependencies.",
    "Advanced Aux row editing still runs MacroFunctionRefresh and EnsureAvailableMacrofunctionIsUsed before the raw stage setter. The complete template factory matching, ReconcileTemplateAndGroup and application subset membership are not reproduced; an unavailable template is replaced with factory type26.",
    "AssignTemplate assigns the default entire microfunction group and UpdateMicrofunctionCodes recodes all source stages using retained scene/ramp/preset data. A scalar stage write does not establish neighbor preservation.",
    "Initialization and UpdateKeyParameters require exact row identities and dependent block/preset/scene/pot state. A bounded no-normalization entry guard has not been closed.",
    "Full-dialog SaveInputSources rewrites every input-to-block Boolean association array and both sensor/aux value branches. A future component projection must disclose that full save is excluded and pin its owned serializer dependencies.",
    "Aux simple-dropdown AttemptExtensionClick reads global preference object+0x1a and can execute a second dialog; capture its explicit policy rather than assuming no extension."
  ],
  "observed_rules": [
    "HandleFunctionComboChange reaches MacroFunctionRefresh, AttemptExtensionClick, shutter recall overrides, SetupGroupCombos and RefreshOtherTabs.",
    "HandleMacroFunctionTemplateAfterChangeEvent function type6 initializes zero block timer to300 and absent expiry command to microfunction type15 (Off).",
    "SetShutterRelayRecallValues writes block LightStoreLevel249/252/255 for function types17/18/20 respectively.",
    "TInputSource.RefreshInputAfterMicroFunctionCodeUpdate invokes EnsureSceneObjectMatchesSelectedScenesInMicrofunctions.",
    "SaveInputSources calls SetSensorValues and SetAuxValues after serializing all input-to-block Boolean arrays.",
    "TInputSource virtual+0x94 resolves RefreshBlocksFromTemplate -> base no-op; this call itself does not regenerate blocks.",
    "TInputSource virtual+0x98 resolves RefreshMacroFunctionFromTemplate, which branches on scene-modify status; ordinary path assigns whole template.",
    "TInputSource virtual+0x9c resolves UpdateMicrofunctionCodes -> base broad source-specific recoding; virtual+0xa0 resolves scene synchronization.",
    "Advanced ComboPropertiesChange branches by row kind: top-level function row invokes UpdateMicroFunction and skips UpdateKeyParameters; child parameter rows invoke UpdateKeyParameters. Both routes then populate the combo and refresh this panel and other tabs.",
    "Advanced UpdateMicroFunction calls SetMicroFunction, MacroFunctionRefresh and EnsureAvailableMacrofunctionIsUsed before SetMicroFunctionCodeByKeyPressStage.",
    "Scene-modify RefreshMacroFunctionFromTemplate calls macro virtual+4, resolved CIS_TCustomFlashObject.Changed at0x7eaa10; it does not assign a template on that branch."
  ],
